{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Orbit Run</strong> is an arcade sci-fi game with roguelike elements, in which you don\u2019t shoot your enemies, but crush them with the asteroids that orbit you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051120/extras/b938d5a2611ab6caa046b54afb058c94.poster.avif?t=1758911801\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051120/extras/b938d5a2611ab6caa046b54afb058c94.webm?t=1758911801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051120/extras/b938d5a2611ab6caa046b54afb058c94.mp4?t=1758911801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your ship\u2019s magnet to pull asteroids into your orbit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051120/extras/fdcd50c03bdd43d97589e2ed24127cd7.poster.avif?t=1758911801\" width=800 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051120/extras/fdcd50c03bdd43d97589e2ed24127cd7.webm?t=1758911801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051120/extras/fdcd50c03bdd43d97589e2ed24127cd7.mp4?t=1758911801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Masterfully navigate to smash through waves of enemies while skillfully dodging their attacks.<strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fuse three base asteroid types into powerful new variants, each with special abilities that can reshape your fighting style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051120/extras/9a41ffe3b2e12eeeaae4ab78fd44ca32.poster.avif?t=1758911801\" width=798 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051120/extras/9a41ffe3b2e12eeeaae4ab78fd44ca32.webm?t=1758911801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051120/extras/9a41ffe3b2e12eeeaae4ab78fd44ca32.mp4?t=1758911801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chart a path through three procedurally generated star systems, each with branching routes and hazards to overcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051120/extras/57a0b368f9d504870fa0109d53966146.poster.avif?t=1758911801\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051120/extras/57a0b368f9d504870fa0109d53966146.webm?t=1758911801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051120/extras/57a0b368f9d504870fa0109d53966146.mp4?t=1758911801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your ship\u2019s systems, strengthen your magnet, and manage asteroids that act as weapons, shields, and currency all at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051120/extras/1056b628181784afed6de0731f9979d2.poster.avif?t=1758911801\" width=800 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051120/extras/1056b628181784afed6de0731f9979d2.webm?t=1758911801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051120/extras/1056b628181784afed6de0731f9979d2.mp4?t=1758911801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow stronger to stand a chance against the final system\u2019s boss encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally generated runs</strong> \u2014 every star system layout, route, and encounter is new.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Asteroid fusion system</strong> \u2014 unlock 3 tiers of recipes, creating hundreds of asteroid variants with special abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 star types</strong> \u2014 each system comes with unique modifiers like solar flares and asteroid storms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>23 enemies total</strong> \u2014 including 15 enemy types, 5 minibosses, and 3 bosses with distinct attack and movement patterns.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4051120?t=1758911801","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4051120?t=1758911801","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051120/e845e0763339bc64f4b257081249df8d8abeb449/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758911801","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051120/e845e0763339bc64f4b257081249df8d8abeb449/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758911801","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Touch Only Option"